    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho mu mwaka ogweikumi n'omunaana nga kyabazinga Yeroboamu mutabane wa Nebati n'afuga Isiraeli, Abiyamu yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaafugira entangama ya myaka esatu mu Yerusalemu. Inhina yali nga ni Maaka, mughala wa Abishalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiyamu oyo yaakola ebibi nga lata we bwe yakola. Yaaloba kugumira ku Musengwa Katonda we, nga dhaadha we Daudi bwe yamugumiraku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ku lwa Daudi, Musengwa Katonda yaagha Abiyamu oyo omwana omulenzi okumusikira ku bwakyabazinga mu Yerusalemu, n'okukuuma Yerusalemu nga kiri miraala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakola ekyo, kuba Daudi yakolanga ebituufu mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda oyo, era tiyavanga ku kye yamulagira enaku dhoonadhoona edh'obulamu bwe, okutoolaku ekyo kye yakola Uria Omuhitti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera kyonakyona Abiyamu kye yamala ng'afuga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "... Kye yamala ng'afuga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rehoboamu ni bwe yafa n'asikirwa mutabane we Abiyamu ku bwakyabazinga, entalo edhaatanukagho ghagati gha kyabazinga Rehoboamu oyo owa Buyudaaya ni kyabazinga Yeroboamu owa Isiraeli, dhaaja bwa mu maiso ng'obwakyabazinga bwombi bulwanagana.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " entalo edhaatanukagho ghagati gha Rehoboamu ni Yeroboamu dhaasigala nga dhikaaja mu maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era dhaaligho ghagati gha Abiyamu oyo ni Yeroboamu. Ebindi byonabyona Abiyamu bye yakola, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo eky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abiyamu oyo yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, era yaaziikibwa mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi. Mutabane we Asa yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.14.1+2CH.14.2+2CH.14.3+2CH.14.4+2CH.14.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 14:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho mu mwaka ogwamakumi abiri (20) nga kyabazinga Yeroboamu n'afuga Isiraeli, Asa yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaafugira entangama ya myaka amakumi ana na mulala (41) mu Yerusalemu. Dhaadha we omukazi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dhaadha we omukazi nga ni Maaka ...:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Luheburayi mulimu “Inhina nga ni Maaka…”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nga ni Maaka mughala wa Abishalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa oyo yaakolanga ebituufu mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, nga dhaadha we Daudi bwe yakolanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoolagho mu nsi eyo omuze ogw'abasaadha ogw'okukolanga obwamalaaya obw'omu isabo. Era yaatoolagho n'ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda, badhaadha be bye baakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaatoola ni ku dhaadha we Maaka ekitiibwa eky'okuba inhina owa kyabazinga, kuba Maaka oyo yali n'ekifaananie ekyenhinhalwa ekyasinzibwanga eky'omusambwa omukazi Ashera. Asa yaatemagho ekifaananie ekyo, yaakyokera ku kaiga Kiduroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2 Byom 15:16—16:6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye waire Asa oyo tiyatoolagho bifo bigulumivu bye baasinzizangamu emisambwa, obulamu bwe bwonabwona yali mwesigwa ye Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaata mu isinzizo ebintu lata we bye yeeyama okughaayo bibe ebya Musengwa Katonda, era ni mwene bye yeeyama okughaayo, ebya zaabu ni feeza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya oyo ni Baasha kyabazinga wa Isiraeli, baalwanagananga mu ntalo mu kiseera kyonakyona eky'obufuzi bwaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Baasha owa Isiraeli yaalumba Buyudaaya. Yaazimba ekimante ekigumu okwezunguluza ekibuga Rama, ghalobe kubaagho ava mu Buyudaaya, waire ajaayo okutuuka ku kyabazinga waayo Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa yaatoolayo feeza yeenayeena ni zaabu eyali asigaire mu iterekero ly'eisinzizo ni mu iterekero erirye nga kyabazinga, yaamugemya abagheereza be bamutwalire kyabazinga Benihadadi ow'e Siria, eyabanga mu Damasiko. Benihadadi oyo, nga ni mutabane wa Taburimmoni era mwidhukulu wa Hezironi. Kyabazinga Asa yaagheereza kyabazinga Benihadadi obukwenda obukoba buti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka tukole endagaano ey'enkolagana ey'aghalala, nga balata baife ye baakola. Bona eno, nkugheereiza ekirabo ekya feeza ni zaabu. Ja omenhegho endagaano yo ey'enkolagana ni kyabazinga Baasha owa Isiraeli, olwo abe ng'ali n'okutoola amagye ge mu kiketezo kyange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Benihadadi yaaganha kyabazinga Asa bye yamukoba. Yaatuma abaduumizi b'eigye lye okulumba ebibuga bya Isiraeli, yaagema ebibuga bino: Iyoni, ni Dani, ni Abeli Bethi Maaka, ni Kinnerothi, n'ekiketezo kyonakyona ekya Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Baasha bwe yawulira ebigwiregho, yaalekera agho okuzimba ekimante ekigumu okwezunguluza ekibuga Rama, yaaja yaaba e Tiruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Asa yaagha Abayudaaya boonaboona ekiragiro, aghazira okulekayo waire omulala ati, baaja baatoola e Rama amabaale n'emiti Baasha bye yali ali kuzimbisa. Asa yaabizimbisa ekimante ekigumu okwezunguluza ebibuga Mizipa era ni Geba eky'omu kiketezo kya Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
