              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Asa bye yakola eby'amaani, n'ebibuga bye yazimba, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya. Aye mu biseera eby'obukaire bwe, yalwala ebigere. ",
          "type": "text",
