              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa oyo yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, era yaaziikibwa mu badhaadha be abo, mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi dhaadha we. Mutabane we Yehoshafati, yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
