          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Baasha mutabane wa Ahiya ow'omu kika kya Issakari, yaalya mu Nadabu oyo olukwe era yaamwitira e Gibbethoni eky'Abafilisiti, Nadabu oyo n'Abaisiraeli boonaboona kye baali bazingiiza okwezunguluza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamwita mu mwaka ogwokusatu ogwa kyabazinga Asa nga n'afuga Buyudaaya. Kale Baasha yaasikira Nadabu oyo ku bwakyabazinga bwa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olwamala okufuuka kyabazinga ati, ng'atoolera kwita ba ndhu ya Yeroboamu boonaboona okubasaaniagho, nga Musengwa Katonda bwe yayogera ng'abita mu mugheereza we omulanzi Ahiya ow'e Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byaligho olw'ebibi Yeroboamu bye yakola, n'aleetera Isiraeli okwonoona, era n'asungughaza Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
