              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Asa ni kyabazinga Baasha owa Isiraeli, bombi baalwanagananga mu ntalo ebiseera byonabyona eby'obufuzi bwaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
