          "text": "Agho mu mwaka ogwokusatu ogwa kyabazinga Asa nga n'afuga Buyudaaya, Baasha mutabane wa Ahiya yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Isiraeli yoonayoona, era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myaka amakumi abiri n'ena, ng'aba e Tiruza. ",
